    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "he's actually starting to get a bit of a stomach ache now too and he's a little bit confused when i talk to him... but i really don't want to drag him to the ER if it's just a virus. that's so much stress. if i give him some tylenol instead, is that safe? or should i just stick with the aspirin idea since it's a stronger fever reducer? i just want to know what i can do right now to help him sleep through the night without having to go to the hospital.",
